{"id":"d039c2f88345c0e7","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-induction-stronger.md","title":"完整真理归纳的严格句法扩张","display":"cor-truth-induction-stronger — 完整真理归纳的严格句法扩张","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-induction-stronger","aliases":["91-cor-truth-induction-stronger","91-cor-induction-power","91-cor-truth-induction-strength"],"display":"cor-truth-induction-stronger — 完整真理归纳的严格句法扩张","depends_on":["[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-induction-stronger"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-induction-stronger</span><span>91-cor-induction-power</span><span>91-cor-truth-induction-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-induction-stronger — 完整真理归纳的严格句法扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_0=\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_0=\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T=\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T=\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是基础语言中没有的新符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}stronger}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Ind}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}stronger}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Ind}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含由公式语言包含给出；取矩阵 T(x) 的归纳实例，它含 T，因而不可能是一个不含 T 的基础实例。\n这是模式严格句法包含。单独加入一个任意谓词的全归纳并不必然增加算术后果；原书全归纳 TB、UTB 的保守性就是警示。具体 KF 的一致性后果另有独立定理，现移除与这一句法推论无关的证明依赖和结论。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1 的 PA_T 与 Definitions 7.1–7.3；模式包含的直接句法证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_0=\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T=\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}stronger}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Ind}_T.","display":true}],"bytes":1247,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-induction-stronger]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-induction-stronger]]"}],"outgoing":["09791de618b277ba"]}